## 7. Standing rules for this exercise

Carried forward from the methodology adopted after four proposals reversed on wider samples:

1. No parameter change on anecdotes — sweep the full universe
2. Score both sides — what a rule admits *and* what it excludes
3. Significance on weekly cohort means, not raw n
4. Require a plateau — a change that works at one exact value is fitted
5. Test at the holding horizon — two findings reversed sign between 4 and 12 weeks
6. Report out-of-sample only
7. Record rejected proposals with the evidence that killed them
